<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-23T15:05:04.863Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:05:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have entered Jurf al-Sakhar, deploying Brigade 72 and establishing checkpoints as Kataib Hezbollah begins a phased withdrawal, while the militia announced its own timetable for leaving. A power-station explosion in Basra killed at least four people and police arrested officers and suspects linked to oil-pipeline smuggling between Dhi Qar and Basra. Senior ISIS leaders were killed in operations in eastern and northeastern Iraq and a new Shiite militia, Asa'ib Al-Jihad, announced its formation. Iran carried out a strike that wounded two people in Bahrain, prompting Saudi condemnation, and the KRG has asked internet providers to block Telegram. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOdGtDVUVuSFA3aldyV3lnZHhnTlJoYm9pa05NNGgyLU85amVrVmRQTU1SZEJjcUJCVFljM0RzOHc5aVhmOTR2c285RnRpRTI1MWpTOW52TG9tRWkySUNtbFQ2RDcxYnAxcG1Kc3BlUmtPekxkcGZyMk5BdTZNeWhYX0NkNTZoWVUzMU02LVlvUVNnVXJCUndZZzRIbEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNS09WSFZPbGR3SkNhZzFFMUFEU0o5QmVkRFVEdWJUOXNaMDBDLWV3a0Fhb1E4WjNXQlU4WUtrMDc3S29NQkMzazA0MlV0Y0hPV2tjWmhPQmZpMG1nLWFvR055Yl94QTZfd1VmZjZTYUJxbzZhNjU0MU0wNUFva1BveW9uSm5sOVVsX2VPZXhtRjZGc1ZHSG54eDFjRXgxWE04T2wybGZfc0Juc1ZpRkE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOSjBOcmN3R2ZhaHFMdTl6QURjLTg2dE1xbkJOVlhISnZDdDJOMHNIMnVxQlBWVzNaM2lBdUpTOTBjdklxT2JmRm9jeW43aTVHTWV5SFNnR0NKR3YyaGUwWnNIdzFVS3NwdUxHV3N3MkVURjZ5dU5lQVR1RWNlNUd0M0FxQkFPZEloTUJPOVk1LWFNMWsyNlByVDhPQ0lGcmtLaHNhZ3dGeWJyMjZQOFpGczlsaUtHYm1EXzJ4WmRoUU05WmtL